    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the highly sought-after area of Bellair, Clonaslee, this impressive three-bedroom bungalow offers the perfect balance of modern energy efficiency, comfortable family living, and breathtaking natural surroundings. The home's efficient air-to-water underfloor heating system delivers year-round comfort and energy savings, while the insulated attic and pumped wall insulation contribute to excellent thermal efficiency. Set on a generous site with a large rear garden and uninterrupted views of the majestic Slieve Bloom Mountains The stunning backdrop creates an ever-changing landscape throughout the seasons, providing a truly picturesque setting for outdoor living. Clonaslee is widely regarded as one of the gateways to the Slieve Bloom Mountains, renowned for its scenic beauty and extensive walking trails, this beautifully maintained home presents an exceptional opportunity for families, retirees, or anyone seeking a peaceful countryside lifestyle without compromising on convenience. Located within walking distance of Clonaslee Village and all local amenities, and just a 15-minute drive from Tullamore, the property enjoys the best of both worlds – tranquil rural living with easy access to schools, shops, restaurants, sporting facilities, and commuter routes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living Room: \t2.90m x 7.30m\r\nKitchen tile surround, electric fireplace, oven hob,\r\ndishwasher, fridge, freezer\r\n\r\nBathroom: \t\t\t3.00m x 1.80m\r\nFully tiled,wetroom shower, WHB & WC\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t\t\t2.93m x 2.91m\r\nLaminate floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t\t4.08m x 2.52m\r\nWood herringbone floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t\t\t4.50m x 3.00m\t\t\r\nCarpet floor, built in wardrobes"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious 3-bedroom bungalow\r\nHighly energy-efficient home Air-to-water heating system Underfloor heating throughout\r\nInsulated attic for enhanced thermal performance\r\nPumped cavity wall insulation\r\nLarge rear garden ideal for family enjoyment and outdoor entertaining\r\nSpectacular views of the Slieve Bloom Mountains\r\nBright and spacious accommodation\r\nWalking distance to Clonaslee Village\r\nExcellent BER performance and reduced energy costs\r\n15-minute drive to Tullamore Town\r\nPeaceful residential location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      },
